---
description: Database migrations are written and run by the user, never by the agent
alwaysApply: true
---

# Manual migrations

Do not generate or apply database migrations. After changing `src/db/schema.ts`, stop and tell the user what SQL they need.

- Never run `pnpm db:generate`, `pnpm db:push`, `pnpm db:migrate`, `pnpm db`, or `drizzle-kit`
- Never add or edit files under `migrations/`

```sql
-- The user writes and runs this. The agent does not.
ALTER TABLE example ADD COLUMN example_flag boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT false;
```
